  "prefLabel": "Bcr 105.02 Necessary Quorum",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bcr 105.02 Necessary Quorum. A quorum shall be required to meet for the purpose of discussion, receiving information, conducting a hearing, or taking final board actions, but final board actions shall be taken only by the affirmative vote of the majority of the board present, and eligible to participate in the matter in question.\n\nSource. #8003, eff 12-12-03",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/bcr100.html"
